  "StockRole": "Missile Boat",
  "YangsThoughts": "Four iATM-9s with enough different ammo types to handle just about any range—that’s a lot of missiles for seventy tons. The ER Medium Lasers mean it’s not helpless when the bins run dry, and the Nova CEWS lets it share targeting data with the rest of the force. Just try not to burn through all that ammo too quickly.",
